-- Partners — field agents, referrals, commissions
-- External talent partners (AGENT role): their KYC profile, referrals they submit, the referral chat thread, commission ledger and payouts.
-- Generated by scripts/db/generate.ts — edit config.ts / types.ts, then re-run.
